# Variant fw202306 of boards/hy300-2023: the first owner's unit (issue #8, GitHub `erfrizzera`, 02.-06.11.2026):
# boot package of 2023-06-25 (U-Boot 2018.05-00005-g6d2f0a5, ARISC 2023-06-25, its own device tree a84bfbd5...),
# a display.bin revision of its own ("ADT-3 2023-06"), database.TSE of its own, under the 2023-06 Android 11 userland.
# Until 13.11.2026 this was the whole board; the TEST image hy300-2023-test1 (05.11.2026) was built for it under the
# name hy300_2023 and still fits it with the installer of its tag. Read after ../../board.env; a key here wins.
VARIANT=fw202306
# nothing of ours has booted on it: TEST images only. Our HY300 Pro installer U-Boot (636 MHz) trained its DRAM over
# FEL (his read, 04.11.2026). The owner has ADB, a partition backup, no full dump yet (asked for), no serial console.
STATUS=profile-only
VERIFIED_BY=
IMAGE_NAME=h713-hy300-2023-fw202306
# the clock of his boot0 at LBA 16 (the HY350 family's block)
DRAM_CLK=792
